    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your very own comic book store!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a comic book store owner and transform your humble store to a bookworm's haven!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy comic licenses, hire staff, and engage in various events such as book signings and collect rare version of comics and sell it at a premium! Use various tools to protect your store from troublemakers and keep your store clean! And explore the surrounding areas inspired by the Japanese backstreets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354220/extras/bafe311a75c1ddb4b0f77627eae0435b.avif?t=1755111671\" width=600 height=71 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354220/extras/c3763f494b2834ca4c319783b54e04c9.poster.avif?t=1755111671\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354220/extras/c3763f494b2834ca4c319783b54e04c9.webm?t=1755111671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354220/extras/c3763f494b2834ca4c319783b54e04c9.mp4?t=1755111671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run and manage your own comic book store!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354220/extras/827f16cc9be970d0c21ae796bcb06345.avif?t=1755111671\" width=600 height=71 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354220/extras/d8a1687779646aea1dbace309096f0d5.poster.avif?t=1755111671\"